        <mxCell id="c117" value="&lt;b&gt;Reconstructed baseline.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No application server exists in the As-Is environment. There is no dedicated database, no shared storage service and no backup scheduler. Availability of the directory depends entirely on one desktop machine remaining switched on and undamaged.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The second working copy on the laptop and the USB copy diverge silently; there is no reconciliation step and no version history." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="1120" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
